<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-18T06:09:44.180Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:09:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces arrested the suspect known as the &amp;quot;Butcher of Baniyas&amp;quot; for the 2013 coastal massacres and foiled an ISIS plot to attack a police patrol in the Damascus countryside. Two Syrian oil pipelines were damaged in attacks on energy infrastructure, while a Syrian soldier was killed and another seriously injured while clearing mines in the Homs countryside. Israeli forces struck Lebanon and detained four individuals in Syria, prompting a Druze leader to praise Prime Minister Netanyahu’s intervention. Traffic accidents and fires caused two deaths and 29 injuries across Syria in the past 24 hours. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQdnVjS2Z5NTMwMndLT1d3SXpnNmt2a2xnU21lWE8wQ0lQTTkyUUtKSXdZTkVDNlZFWHREaERBWFF0bkR4Ui0zM3FMc3VGZVB3aHI1LU5UTG5NZXIybjZfQ2xJcDZSMDRYbnBZRmJKRWJXcm5TR1k0SkplZlNXTkljZlpQclJHNjRuSm94S2ZUQVlQSnUwQzEzT0JZWjFrNVA2VGl0VA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOdnVPWWNJM2laYzBYTWx3Y0RIRGpyY3pXSmkzNWtkQUNPTXJSVG9SdkJ1eWhoZ3ZmbGhqQmxCdjVKdWkwRmJVSUNRalJVNnhLSXVKQWFWUUhjbEk0OWU4Umw5T0FXRzI3Yk14aTByYjZrY0Z4QnBfSjM2OVJJNV9STHhHcDJ4dThuNm1ad2R4My1hZDd5b3g3b2wtM1lONzE4M0JkaFU3cVZVLTJLZVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFAwNHF2Z3JreGFGRUNCQXNhR2t2OVFtOTVlTmJ3dXdJakY3Vkt5eF9QbmcwaHNVTkNEM2V3SWFVZmZEbkk0MmpCOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQbTNOZUlkN3piejRDX0NjUVRjUEpabG5yeUdDdENmUmg3dkF0cTNSRWstb2E5VTZJaG85N3ZpckVEN1RLYW9ORDlnU1pYNVJaRVdhM0duTjh5aG5rSldxakI5WU5ReXRQamxKdDZkV0ZmSnU5YV